    "description": "Availability is the proportion of time a system or service is operational and accessible to users. It is typically expressed as a percentage, such as 99.9% ``three nines`` or 99.99% ``four nines``, calculated over a given period.\n\nHigh availability is achieved through redundancy, fail-over mechanisms, health checks, and careful deployment strategies that minimize unplanned downtime.",
